B.aMH=A.a(s(["Bug\xfcn d\xf6kt\xfc\u011f\xfcn her damla al\u0131n teri, yar\u0131n ba\u015far\u0131 olarak kar\u015f\u0131na \xe7\u0131kacak.","Zorluklar, ba\u015far\u0131n\u0131n de\u011ferini art\u0131ran s\xfcslerdir. Asla pes etme!","Ba\u015far\u0131, her g\xfcn tekrarlanan k\xfc\xe7\xfck \xe7abalar\u0131n toplam\u0131d\u0131r.","B\xfcy\xfck hayaller kur ve ba\u015farmaya cesaret et.","Gelecek, bug\xfcnden ona haz\u0131rlananlara aittir.","\u015eampiyonlar antrenman salonlar\u0131ndan de\u011fil, i\xe7lerindeki tutkudan \xe7\u0131kar.","Yoruldu\u011funda dinlenmeyi \xf6\u011fren, b\u0131rakmay\u0131 de\u011fil.","Bug\xfcn yapaca\u011f\u0131n bir soru fazlas\u0131, yar\u0131n binlerce ki\u015finin \xf6n\xfcne ge\xe7meni sa\u011flayabilir.","Kendine inan! Sen d\xfc\u015f\xfcnd\xfc\u011f\xfcnden \xe7ok daha g\xfc\xe7l\xfcs\xfcn.","Hedefe giden yol disiplinden ge\xe7er, motivasyon gelir ge\xe7er ama disiplin kazand\u0131r\u0131r."]),t.s)
